<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ description }}">
{% if canonical %}<link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical }}">{% endif %}
<meta property="og:type" content="{{ og_type | default('website') }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ title }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ description }}">
{% if canonical %}<meta property="og:url" content="{{ canonical }}">{% endif %}
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/page.css">
<script src="/theme.js"></script>
{% block head_extra %}{% endblock %}
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="logo" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="lg" x1="4" y1="2" x2="28" y2="30" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#4F8DFF"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#1D4ED8"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="32" height="32" rx="9" fill="url(#lg)"/><circle cx="16" cy="16.8" r="9.2" fill="#0B2A8F" opacity=".18"/><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="9.2" fill="#fff"/><path d="M11.8 16.4l3 3 5.6-6.4" fill="none" stroke="#1D4ED8" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="24.6" cy="7.4" r="2.2" fill="#FBBF24"/></svg></span>내 혜택 찾기</a>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/">내 조건으로 찾기</a>
      <button class="theme-btn" type="button" data-theme-toggle aria-label="화면 모드 전환 (라이트/다크)" title="화면 모드 전환"><svg class="i-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1111.2 3a7 7 0 009.8 9.8z"/></svg><svg class="i-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"/></svg></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
{% block main %}{% endblock %}
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% block footer_note %}{% endblock %}
    <p>출처: 행정안전부 공공서비스(혜택) 정보 · 데이터 기준일 {{ updated }}</p>
    <p><a href="/privacy">개인정보 처리 안내</a> · 이 서비스는 공공데이터를 안내하며 정부·지자체와 무관합니다.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
